みたいな感じで対峙する2人。\nセツコ「こんな所で遊んでいたのね…早く家に帰りなさい、穀潰し」\nアキラ「ハン！いつもみたいに言う事聞くとは思わない事だね。勝ってその身体に分からせてやる！」\n\n2・アキラを組み敷いてちんぐり騎乗位で犯すセツコ（普通の騎乗位でもOK）\nセツコ「この穀潰しが！こんな粗末なチンポで誰を分からせるって！？\n生まれ変わって出直してきなさい！」\nアキラ「んひっ💕や、やめっ💕あ、あ、イク、もうイク、イクぅぅぅ💕」\n\n●補足\n内容、セリフ、体位などアレンジ可。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E4DlacUUcAAxGi-?format=jpg&name=large", "nc": 185, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@anchobibi_fg/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f922b41/uploads/origins/a8e84a8e-d0cb-4906-b8f6-7f960189083f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4f045cdc42957b6d0ce3091f8d908850", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5f922b41/uploads/origins/a8e84a8e-d0cb-4906-b8f6-7f960189083f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4f045cdc42957b6d0ce3091f8d908850, https://si.imgix.net/5f922b41/uploads/origins/a8e84a8e-d0cb-4906-b8f6-7f960189083f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8efac17ee0be04f3e8c6e57f9e972f0f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5f922b41/uploads/origins/a8e84a8e-d0cb-4906-b8f6-7f960189083f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1b0b820858071e79e9e55cc9b9aac06e 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 595621, "client_id": 448918, "nc": 161}, {"path": "/@anchobibi_fg/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 595621, "client_id": 398841, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.